        "answer": "Constructs CoD.WarzoneDeathCamLabelButton from the displayed menu/controller/layout arguments. Creates DeathCamLabel as LUI.UIText.new, DeathCamLabelPC as LUI.UIText.new. Registers state predicates PC with exact ordered tests below. Connects 2 model/path references; the model subscription effects below specify which receiver changes and under which nil/value guard. Installs 1 event/action/override bindings; each callback keeps its captured controller/menu/widget references and executes only on its bound delivery. The ordered effect contract retains every property, model, visual, navigation, callback and return mutation in source order; returning self is not proof the original game loads this widget.",
